ve.\0102. Find Zuzan sitting across The Ring of Glory Vendors\0103. Find Zan'ja croaching atop one of the Defiant Ring pillars. Talk to him.\0104. Find Ru'ko meditating atop one of the Arches of The Ring of Glory. Talk to her.\0105. Go back to the Nameless Grave.",["headers"]={-732,-56},["localFacts"]={["coords"]={["2512"]={{67.3,48.5}}},["kind"]="Object",["objectID"]=645549,["questID"]=95956,["record"]=252761},["lvl"]=90,["mapID"]=2512,["maps"]={2639,2640,2641,2642,2643,2644,2645},["objectID"]=645549,["providers"]={{"n",263244},{"o",645553}},["questID"]=95956},["95995"]={["awp"]=120100,["coords"]={["2512"]={{70.6,76.6}}},["cost"]={{"i",271881,1}},["crs"]={263347},["description"]="1. Find a 'Bubbling Clam' under water to the south of the Cave and obtain a 'Luminescent Pearl'.\0102. Go to the cave and present the Pearl to 'Nacretta'. It will give you the Key in exchange.\0103. Loot the 'Dropped Key' and open the treasure.",["headers"]={-732,-56},["localFacts"]={["coords"]={["2512"]={{70.6,76.6}}},["cost"]={{"i",271881,1}},["kind"]="Object",["objectID"]=649085,["questID"]=95995,["record"]=252736},["lvl"]=90,["mapID"]=2512,["maps"]={2639,2640,2641,2642,2643,2644,2645},["objectID"]=649085,["questID"]=95995},["96048"]={["awp"]=120007,["coords"]={["2393"]={{48.3,64.6}}},["crs"]={264308},["description"]="Can be accepted from the Adventure Journal.",["expansionID"]=12,["headers"]={-735,-759,-45},["localFacts"]={["coords"]={["2393"]={{48.3,64.6}}},["description"]="Can be accepted from the Adventure Journal.",["kind"]="Quest",["qgs"]={263929},["questID"]=96048,["record"]=120277},["lvl"]=80,["mapID"]=2599,["maps"]={2617,2618,2619,2620,2621},["qgs"]={263929},["questID"]=96048},["96049"]={["awp"]=120007,["coords"]={["2393"]={{47.6,51}}},["crs"]={264308},["description"]="Val is a planet of nothing but ice-covered valleys and billowing storms; even the Legion loathed it. The planet is protected by enormous hailstorms capable of tearing through the hulls of Legion ships, and even a