 Push returns in Dragonflight Season 4\010\010Instead of teams fighting to beat their opponent's time, The Great Push is focused on teams pushing keys as high as they can, striving to out survive their competitors and be crowned the champion!\010\010All registered teams that complete under time the two dungeons within the Proving Grounds will receive the exclusive Smoldering Banner of the Aspects to use in-game!\010Sign-ups close 15 Jun 2024 and The Proving Grounds are on 19-24 June (US).",["headers"]={-736,-515},["itemId"]=218128,["lineage"]={{["awp"]=100206,["b"]=1,["description"]="The Great Push returns in Dragonflight Season 4\010\010Instead of teams fighting to beat their opponent's time, The Great Push is focused on teams pushing keys as high as they can, striving to out survive their competitors and be crowned the champion!\010\010All registered teams that complete under time the two dungeons within the Proving Grounds will receive the exclusive Smoldering Banner of the Aspects to use in-game!\010Sign-ups close 15 Jun 2024 and The Proving Grounds are on 19-24 June (US).",["itemID"]=218128,["kind"]="Toy",["record"]=299467,["rwp"]=100207,["u"]=2}},["localFacts"]={["awp"]=100206,["b"]=1,["description"]="The Great Push returns in Dragonflight Season 4\010\010Instead of teams fighting to beat their opponent's time, The Great Push is focused on teams pushing keys as high as they can, striving to out survive their competitors and be crowned the champion!\010\010All registered teams that complete under time the two dungeons within the Proving Grounds will receive the exclusive Smoldering Banner of the Aspects to use in-game!\010Sign-ups close 15 Jun 2024 and The Proving Grounds are on 19-24 June (US).",["itemID"]=218128,["kind"]="Toy",["record"]=299467,["rwp"]=100207,["u"]=2},["rwp"]=100207,["u"]=2},["id"]="att-218128-3ae2eab76082",["guideIds"]={}}}},{["toyId"]=1533,["itemId"]=218308,["name"]="Winter Veil Cracker",["icon"]="inv_11xp_holiday_xmascracker01",["routes"]=