ers the Blue-Covered Beanbag later on the Renown track."},{["id"]="toys-tuskarr-vendors:step-3",["text"]="For the sleds, visit Kiopo’s island southeast of Iskaara when Renown 26 is unlocked. Buy and learn only the toys still missing."}},["destination"]={["mapID"]=2024,["x"]=0.1316,["y"]=0.49200000000000005},["outcome"]="guaranteed-progress",["currentPeriodFlag"]=false,["playStyle"]="solo",["coverage"]="directions",["validation"]={["sourceChecked"]=false,["playtested"]=false,["automated"]=false,["gaps"]={"Detailed actions and prerequisites have not been validated."},["completePath"]=false}},{["id"]="toys-expedition-vendors",["title"]="Collect Expedition comforts and banners",["zone"]="The Waking Shores · Dragonscale Basecamp",["expansion"]="Dragonflight",["method"]="Reputation vendor",["cadence"]="repeatable",["minutes"]=10,["rewards"]={199902,198720,198721,198722,198728,198729},["dropEstimates"]={},["requirements"]={},["questIds"]={},["warband"]=true,["source"]="https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/0bb8f4be59bcc0262830400914516ef1698d789e/.contrib/.db/standard/06%20-%20Expansion%20Features/10%20-%20Dragonflight/01%20Dragonscale%20Expedition/Vendors.lua",["details"]="Wayfinder’s Compass is a Renown quest reward; the pillows and banners also have vendor/material costs. Check the current reward panel before farming more reputation.",["steps"]={{["id"]="toys-expedition-vendors:step-1",["text"]="Visit Pathfinder Jeb and claim Wayfinder’s Compass when its Renown 9 quest is offered."},{["id"]="toys-expedition-vendors:step-2",["text"]="Check Rae’ana for the three research pillows at Renown 17 and the Expedition vendors for banners at Renown 19."},{["id"]="toys-expedition-vendors:step-3",["text"]="If a reward is locked, complete available Expedition world quests and weekly wanted posters, or turn in Dragon Isles Artifacts."}},["destination"]={["mapID"]=2022,["x"]=0.47100000000000003,["y"]=0.826},["outcome"]="guaranteed-progress",["currentPeriodFlag"]=false,["play