lternatives and their detailed entrances/lockouts are research leads, not counted complete here.","Actual intro, one daily session, city ceremony, writ trade, purchase/learn and Black Knight encounter checks remain pending."},["completePath"]=false,["checkpointChecked"]=true,["pathAudit"]="Source-checked checkpoints do not establish a complete fresh-character path.",["observedEntryPathChecked"]=true},["coverageGaps"]={},["persistent"]=true},{["id"]="legion-archaeology",["title"]="Dariness's archaeology reward",["zone"]="Broken Isles Dalaran · Dariness the Learned",["expansion"]="Legion",["method"]="Archaeology",["cadence"]="fortnightly",["minutes"]=30,["essential"]=true,["persistent"]=true,["rewards"]={131717,131724},["source"]="https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/0bb8f4be59bcc0262830400914516ef1698d789e/.contrib/.db/standard/10%20-%20Professions/Archaeology.lua",["system"]="archaeology",["questIds"]={41164,41165,41166,40857,41157,41158,41159,41802,41167,41168,41169,41161,41162,41163,41174,41175,41176,41180,41181,41182,41177,41178,41179,41183,41184,41185,41171,41172,41173,41189,41190,41191,41186,41187,41188,41192,41193},["steps"]={{["id"]="legion-archaeology:observe",["kind"]="observe",["text"]="Use the Broken Isles version of Dalaran, not Northrend Dalaran. Speak with Dariness in Things of the Past. If Archaeology is not learned, inspect her trainer service and learn the secondary profession yourself. Open Archaeology and confirm Survey is available. Training remains player-controlled. Inspect her actually offered quest to identify this character’s current chain. If none is offered, check character level, current phase and the active quest log; choose another activity while the missing condition is researched.",["destination"]={["mapID"]=627,["x"]=0.404,["y"]=0.24,["label"]="Dariness in Things of the Past, Legion Dalaran"},["sources"]={"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/.contrib/.db/stan