1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=16762","https://www.wowhead.com/item=200631"},["recovery"]={["text"]="Recheck the named room, selected difficulty and current game objectives. Continue advances only the guide cursor; it never records a kill, unlock, purchase or ownership."},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=16762,["scope"]="account"},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=200631,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=200631}}}}},["manual"]=true,["after"]={"att-200631-ea2a6ad3a95a:treemouth-cave"}},{["id"]="att-200631-ea2a6ad3a95a:mail",["kind"]="receive",["text"]="Collect the thank-you mail from Bertinaut, Sentiu and Japukitat and take Happy Tuskarr Palooza from the letter.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=16762","https://www.wowhead.com/item=200631"},["recovery"]={["text"]="The reward is mailed. If the achievement did not complete, recheck the guarded side cages during the same visit; a guessed total or freeing only the marked coast cages is insufficient."},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=200631,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=200631}}},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=200631,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=200631}}}}},["after"]={"att-200631-ea2a6ad3a95a:finish-rescue"}},{["id"]="att-200631-ea2a6ad3a95a:learn",["kind"]="learn",["text"]="Use Happy Tuskarr Palooza from your bags to learn the toy.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/item=200631"},["recovery"]={["text"]="Only Toy Box ownership finishes this goal. Loot, mail, an achievement and the guide cursor remain separate evidence."},["completeWhen"]={["kind"]