ve tracking, but its source-specific objective instructions and recovery have not been authored.","Quest 76145 has live objective tracking, but its source-specific objective instructions and recovery have not been authored.","Quest 76146 has live objective tracking, but its source-specific objective instructions and recovery have not been authored."},["completePath"]=false},["coverageGaps"]={"Quest 76143: AND/OR semantics for 76141, 76142 are not established.","Quest 76143 has live objective tracking, but its source-specific objective instructions and recovery have not been authored.","Quest 76144 has live objective tracking, but its source-specific objective instructions and recovery have not been authored.","Quest 76145 has live objective tracking, but its source-specific objective instructions and recovery have not been authored.","Quest 76146 has live objective tracking, but its source-specific objective instructions and recovery have not been authored."}},{["id"]="att-208096-a76815162308",["title"]="Familiar Journal",["zone"]="Map 22",["expansion"]="Classic",["method"]="Instance",["cadence"]="once",["minutes"]=10,["rewards"]={208096},["requirements"]={},["destination"]={["mapID"]=22,["x"]=0.6907,["y"]=0.7295999999999999},["questIds"]={76249},["source"]="https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua",["details"]="Structured route facts from the pinned ATT dataset. Check the offered quest, vendor stock or encounter in game; location and requirements are not a guarantee of a drop.",["metadataRoute"]=true,["costs"]={},["facts"]={["awp"]=100105,["b"]=1,["category"]="Instances",["coords"]={["22"]={{69.07,72.96}}},["description"]="The Familiar Journal itself can be found in the Viewing Room of Old Scholomance, on the second bookshelf from the left wall, near the mini-boss Marduk Blackpool. All you have to do is pick up the book, and the toy is yours! It's as simple as that.",["expansionID"]=1,["headers"]={-75,-56},["instanceID"]=246,["itemId"]=208096,["lineage"]={{["coords"]={["22"]={{69.07,72.96}}},["instanceID"]=246,["kind"]="Instance",["mapID"]=476,["maps"]={477,478,479},["record"]=334720},{["description"]="The Familiar Journal itself can be found in the Viewing Room of Old Scholomance, on the second bookshelf from the left wall, near the mini-boss Marduk Blackpool. All you have to do is pick up the book, and the toy is yours! It's as simple as that.",["kind"]="Object",["objectID"]=405388,["record"]=334819},{["b"]=1,["itemID"]=208096,["kind"]="Toy",["record"]=334820}},["localFacts"]={["b"]=1,["itemID"]=208096,["kind"]="Toy",["record"]=334820},["mapID"]=306,["maps"]={307,308,309},["objectID"]=405388,["sourceQuests"]={76249}},["steps"]={{["id"]="att-208096-a76815162308:get-krastinov-toy",["kind"]="observe",["text"]="If Memory of Scholomance is not already unlocked, obtain Krastinov’s Bag of Horrors using the complete Heroic Scholomance rare guide. You may instead bring a player who uses that toy at the later bone pile.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096"},["recovery"]={["text"]="Open the linked Heroic Scholomance guide for the full three-boss route and rare check. A friend using the toy is an alternative only when Eva actually appears; do not create ownership on this character."},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=88566}}},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=208096,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=208096}}}}},["when"]={["negate"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}}},["manual"]=true,["sharedSubguideId"]="heroic-scholomance-krastinov",["linkedGuideId"]="att-88566-471161610f20"},{["id"]="att-208096-a76815162308:ritual-materials",["kind"]="prepare",["text"]="For a new Spectral Essence, obtain three Dark Runes (20520) and five Essence of Undeath (12808), for example through a player-chosen Auction House purchase. Skip this preparation if you already have Spectral Essence.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096","https://www.wowhead.com/item=206365","https://www.wowhead.com/npc=11285"},["recovery"]={["text"]="Dark Rune is the tradable item 20520, not Demonic Rune. Auction prices are unknown until inspected; Toybox never buys or spends for you. Check bank storage for an existing unique Spectral Essence first."},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}},{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=13544,["quantity"]=1},{["all"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=20520,["quantity"]=3},{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=12808,["quantity"]=5}}}}},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=208096,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=208096}}}}},["when"]={["negate"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}}},["manual"]=true,["after"]={"att-208096-a76815162308:get-krastinov-toy"}},{["id"]="att-208096-a76815162308:modern-entry",["kind"]="travel",["text"]="Enter modern Scholomance and clear the path through its classrooms. Use Heroic if you still need the rare toy; with the toy available, the ritual’s modern dungeon visit can use Normal or Heroic.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096"},["recovery"]={["text"]="Recheck the named room, selected difficulty and current game objectives. Continue advances only the guide cursor; it never records a kill, unlock, purchase or ownership."},["destination"]={["mapID"]=22,["x"]=0.6907,["y"]=0.7296,["label"]="Modern Scholomance entrance",["directions"]="Enter Caer Darrow keep and use the ordinary dungeon portal, not Eva’s Enchanted Journal."},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=208096,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=208096}}}}},["when"]={["negate"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}}},["manual"]=true,["after"]={"att-208096-a76815162308:ritual-materials"}},{["id"]="att-208096-a76815162308:clear-chillheart",["kind"]="objective",["text"]="In the first classroom, defeat Instructor Chillheart. If her body falls but combat continues, destroy the phylactery and stay ahead of the advancing ice wall.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blo