beyond the rare’s room to Lilian Voss. During her soul phase move away from the pursuing soul and the purple flames; let the scripted phases finish before continuing toward the headmaster.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096","https://www.wowhead.com/npc=59200"},["recovery"]={["text"]="Recheck the named room, selected difficulty and current game objectives. Continue advances only the guide cursor; it never records a kill, unlock, purchase or ownership."},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=208096,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=208096}}}}},["when"]={["negate"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}}},["manual"]=true,["after"]={"att-208096-a76815162308:clear-rattlegore"}},{["id"]="att-208096-a76815162308:gandling",["kind"]="objective",["text"]="Pass the Viewing Room and descend into Headmaster’s Retreat. Defeat Darkmaster Gandling. If Harsh Lesson teleports you away, clear the study-room enemies to return; dispelling a living subject can burst nearby undead.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096","https://www.wowhead.com/npc=59080"},["recovery"]={["text"]="Recheck the named room, selected difficulty and current game objectives. Continue advances only the guide cursor; it never records a kill, unlock, purchase or ownership."},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=208096,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=208096}}}}},["when"]={["negate"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}}},["manual"]=true,["after"]={"att-208096-a76815162308:lilian"}},{["id"]="att-208096-a76815162308:summon-eva",["kind"]="interact",["text"]="After Gandling, go to the upper central study room and stand by its bone pile. Use Krastinov’s Bag of Horrors, or have your companion use it there, to reveal Eva Sarkhoff. Remove the Surgical Alterations toy buff so she will speak to you.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096"},["recovery"]={["text"]="The ordinary Caer Darrow ghost and the newly summoned dungeon Eva are different interactions. Check the upper room and bone pile, then remove the disguise. Continue only moves the cursor until her actual dialogue or item is observed."},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}},{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=206365,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=13544,["quantity"]=1}}},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=208096,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=208096}}}}},["when"]={["negate"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}}},["manual"]=true,["after"]={"att-208096-a76815162308:gandling"}},{["id"]="att-208096-a76815162308:eva-dialogue",["kind"]="interact",["text"]="Speak with the revealed Eva and exhaust her ritual dialogue. Receive Inert Spectral Essence if you do not already have Spectral Essence. Loot Eva’s Femur from the adjacent bones.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096","https://www.wowhead.com/item=206365"},["recovery"]={["text"]="If no Inert Spectral Essence is offered, look for the existing unique trinket in bags or bank. Speak before trying to loot the femur; do not discard veteran items."},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}},{["all"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=206365,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=13544,["quantity"]=1}}},{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=206364,["quantity"]=1}}}}},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=208096,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=208096}}}}},["when"]={["negate"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}}},["manual"]=true,["after"]={"att-208096-a76815162308:summon-eva"}},{["id"]="att-208096-a76815162308:eva-journal",["kind"]="collect",["text"]="Before leaving, return to the Viewing Room. Walk behind the southwestern bookcase near the doorway and collect Eva’s Journal from its shelf.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096"},["recovery"]={["text"]="Recheck the named room, selected difficulty and current game objectives. Continue advances only the guide cursor; it never records a kill, unlock, purchase or ownership."},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}},{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=206346,["quantity"]=1}}},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=208096,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=208096}}}}},["when"]={["negate"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}}},["manual"]=true,["after"]={"att-208096-a76815162308:eva-dialogue"}},{["id"]="att-208096-a76815162308:restore-essence",["kind"]="craft",["text"]="Use Inert Spectral Essence with the three Dark Runes and five Essence of Undeath to restore Spectral Essence. Equip the restored trinket before looking for Caer Darrow’s ghosts.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096","https://www.wowhead.com/item=206365"},["recovery"]={["text"]="Restoring consumes the listed materials and is a player action. If the trinket is already restored, equip it rather than making another. Inventory possession alone does not prove that it is equipped."},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}},{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=13544,["quantity"]=1}}},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=208096,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=208096}}}}},["when"]={["negate"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}}},["manual"]=true,["consumesItems"]={{["itemId"]=20520,["quantity"]=3},{["itemId"]=12808,["quantity"]=5}},["after"]={"att-208096-a76815162308:eva-journal"}},{["id"]="att-208096-a76815162308:collect-water",["kind"]="collect",["text"]="Collect the water bucket beside the fountain.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096"},["recovery"]={["text"]="These ritual objects require Eva’s introduction. Keep the live ritual items; already exchanged items need not be collected again. If the object is absent, check Eva’s dialogue and whether the matching candle is already in bags."},["destination"]={["mapID"]=22,["x"]=0.688,["y"]=0.789,["label"]="Water by Caer Darrow fountain"},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}},{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=206359,["quantity"