8096-a76815162308:collect-road",["kind"]="collect",["text"]="Take the painting from the wall by the end of the tavern bar.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096"},["recovery"]={["text"]="These ritual objects require Eva’s introduction. Keep the live ritual items; already exchanged items need not be collected again. If the object is absent, check Eva’s dialogue and whether the matching candle is already in bags. A later report conflicts with the five-candle source: if The Road Ahead is absent, try the ritual with the other gathered components and let the actual ritual requirements decide. Do not infer that this component is removed for every character."},["destination"]={["mapID"]=23,["x"]=0.55,["y"]=0.641,["label"]="Corin’s Crossing inn"},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}},{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=206363,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=206358,["quantity"]=1}}},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=208096,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=208096}}}}},["when"]={["negate"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}}},["manual"]=true,["after"]={"att-208096-a76815162308:trade-doll"}},{["id"]="att-208096-a76815162308:trade-road",["kind"]="purchase",["text"]="With Spectral Essence equipped, speak to Artist Renfray and trade The Road Ahead for Imported Candle. Confirm the trade yourself.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096"},["recovery"]={["text"]="If the ghost is invisible, equip Spectral Essence. Check the exact item and NPC; a trade consumes the memento. Do not infer it occurred from arrival. A later report conflicts with the five-candle source: if The Road Ahead is absent, try the ritual with the other gathered components and let the actual ritual requirements decide. Do not infer that this component is removed for every character."},["destination"]={["mapID"]=22,["x"]=0.658,["y"]=0.754,["label"]="Artist Renfray"},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}},{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=206358,["quantity"]=1}}},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=208096,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=208096}}}}},["when"]={["negate"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}}},["manual"]=true,["consumesItems"]={{["itemId"]=206363,["quantity"]=1}},["npcId"]=11936,["after"]={"att-208096-a76815162308:collect-road"}},{["id"]="att-208096-a76815162308:collect-smokes",["kind"]="collect",["text"]="Enter the living-side main gate. Take the left streets into King’s Square and collect the small shipment from the wagon behind the fountain.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096"},["recovery"]={["text"]="These ritual objects require Eva’s introduction. Keep the live ritual items; already exchanged items need not be collected again. If the object is absent, check Eva’s dialogue and whether the matching candle is already in bags."},["destination"]={["mapID"]=23,["x"]=0.2782,["y"]=0.1156,["label"]="Stratholme main entrance"},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}},{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=206360,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=206355,["quantity"]=1}}},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=208096,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=208096}}}}},["when"]={["negate"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}}},["manual"]=true,["after"]={"att-208096-a76815162308:trade-road"}},{["id"]="att-208096-a76815162308:trade-smokes",["kind"]="purchase",["text"]="With Spectral Essence equipped, speak to Rory and trade Undelivered Shipment of Smokes for Tobacco-Filled Candle. Confirm the trade yourself.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096"},["recovery"]={["text"]="If the ghost is invisible, equip Spectral Essence. Check the exact item and NPC; a trade consumes the memento. Do not infer it occurred from arrival."},["destination"]={["mapID"]=22,["x"]=0.634,["y"]=0.756,["label"]="Rory"},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}},{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=206355,["quantity"]=1}}},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=208096,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=208096}}}}},["when"]={["negate"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}}},["manual"]=true,["consumesItems"]={{["itemId"]=206360,["quantity"]=1}},["npcId"]=11285,["after"]={"att-208096-a76815162308:collect-smokes"}},{["id"]="att-208096-a76815162308:ritual",["kind"]="interact",["text"]="Keep all five candles, Eva’s Journal and Eva’s Femur. In Caer Darrow keep, turn right instead of entering the modern dungeon portal; follow the corridor to the room with a floor grate and bones. Use Eva’s Journal to perform the ritual.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096"},["recovery"]={["text"]="This room is outside the dungeon instance. Check all seven ritual items before using the journal. The ritual consumes them; the observed achievement/unlock, not Continue, establishes access."},["destination"]={["mapID"]=22,["x"]=0.6979,["y"]=0.7186,["label"]="Ritual room in Caer Darrow keep"},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=208096,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=208096}}}}},["when"]={["negate"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}}},["manual"]=true,["after"]={"att-208096-a76815162308:trade-smokes"}},{["id"]="att-208096-a76815162308:old-entry",["kind"]="interact",["text"]="Click Eva’s Enchanted Journal on the ritual pedestal and choose to enter the Memory of Scholomance. If your account already unlocked it, begin directly here.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096"},["recovery"]={["text"]="Use the book on the pedestal, not the ordinary blue dungeon portal. If it is absent, complete the ritual branch; an account achievement can support this specific account-wide unlock."},["destination"]={["mapID"]=22,["x"]=0.6979,["y"]=0.7186,["label"]="Eva’s Enchanted Journal"},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=208096,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=208096}}},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=208096,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=208096}}}}},["manual"]=true,["after"]={"att-208096-a76815162308:ritual"}},{["id"]="att-208096-a76815162308:old-viewing-room",["kind"]="travel",["text"]="In old Scholomance, follow the dungeon corridors through the Reliquary toward the Great Ossuary. Defeat old Rattlegore below the ossuary and loot the Viewing Room Key if the Viewing Room door is locked; return upstairs and open that door.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096"},["recovery"]={["text"]="The modern and original Rattlegores are different encounters. If the door is already open, use it. Do not clear all six final study rooms merely to reach the journal."},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=208096,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=208096}}},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=208096,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=208096}}}}},["manual"]=true,["after"]={"att-208096-a76815162308:old-entry"},["writtenDestination"]="Memory of Scholomance: follow the Reliquary corridors to the Great Ossuary. Descend into the bone pit for old Rattlegore and the key, then return upstairs to the Viewing Room door."},{["id"]="att-208096-a76815162308:journal-loot",["kind"]="loot",["text"]="Inside the old Viewing Room, look behind Marduk Blackpool at the second bookcase from the left wall. Loot the small horizontal Familiar Journal from the upper shelf, partly obscured by other books.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096"},["recovery"]={["text"]="This is the original dungeon’s Familiar Journal, not Eva’s ritual journal from the modern dungeon. Circle behind the shelf and inspect carefully; receiving or using Eva’s book does not grant this toy."},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=208096,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=208096}}},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=208096,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=208096}}}}},["after"]={"att-208096-a76815162308:old-viewing-room"},["writtenDestination"]="Old Scholomance Viewing Room: behind Marduk Blackpool, inspect the second bookcase from the left wall. The small horizontal journal is partly hidden on an upper shelf."},{["id"]="att-208096-a76815162308:learn",["kind"]="learn",["text"]="Use Familiar Journal from your bags to learn the toy.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096"},["recovery"]={["text"]="Only Toy Box ownership finishes this goal. Loot, mail, an achievement and the guide cursor remain separate evidence."},["completeWhen"]={["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=208096},["requires"]={["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=208096,["quantity"]=1},["after"]={"att-208096-a76815162308:journal-loot"}}},["outcome"]="guaranteed-progress",["currentPeriodFlag"]=false,["playStyle"]="group",["coverage"]="walkthrough",["walkthrough"]={["version"]=2,["contentVersion"]="2.4.0",["routeIds"]={"att-208096-a76815162308"},["includesPrerequisites"]=true,["completeWhen"]={["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=208096},["nodes"]={{["id"]="att-208096-a76815162308:get-krastinov-toy",["kind"]="observe",["text"]="If Memory of Scholomance is not already unlocked, obtain Krastinov’s Bag of Horrors using the complete Heroic Scholomance rare guide. You may instead bring a player who uses that toy at the later bone pile.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096"},["recovery"]={["text"]="Open the linked Heroic Scholomance guide for the full three-boss route and rare check. A friend using the toy is an alternative only when Eva actually appears; do not create ownership on this character."},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=88566}}},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=208096,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=208096}}}}},["when"]={["negate"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}}},["manual"]=true,["sharedSubguideId"]="heroic-scholomance-krastinov",["linkedGuideId"]="att-88566-471161610f20"},{["id"]="att-208096-a76815162308:ritual-materials",["kind"]="prepare",["text"]="For a new Spectral Essence, obtain three Dark Runes (20520) and five Essence of Undeath (12808), for example through a player-chosen Auction House purchase. Skip this preparation if you already have Spectral Essence.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096","https://www.wowhead.com/item=206365","https://www.wowhead.com/npc=11285"},["recovery"]={["text"]="Dark Rune is the tradable item 20520, not Demonic Rune. Auction prices are unknown until inspected; Toybox never buys or spends for you. Check bank storage for an existing unique Spectral Essence first."},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}},{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=13544,["quantity"]=1},{["all"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=20520,["quantity"]=3},{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=12808,["quantity"]=5}}}}},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=208096,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=208096}}}}},["when"]={["negate"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}}},["manual"]=true,["after"]={"att-208096-a76815162308:get-krastinov-toy"}},{["id"]="att-208096-a76815162308:modern-entry",["kind"]="travel",["text"]="Enter modern Scholomance and clear the path through its classrooms. Use Heroic if you still need the rare toy; with the toy available, the ritual’s modern dungeon visit can use Normal or Heroic.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096"},["recovery"]={["text"]="Recheck the named room, selected difficulty and current game objectives. Continue advances only the guide cursor; it never records a kill, unlock, purchase or ownership."},["destination"]={["mapID"]=22,["x"]=0.6907,["y"]=0.7296,["label"]="Modern Scholomance entrance",["directions"]="Enter Caer Darrow keep and use the ordinary dungeon portal, not Eva’s Enchanted Journal."},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=208096,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=208096}}}}},["when"]={["negate"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}}},["manual"]=true,["after"]={"att-208096-a76815162308:ritual-materials"}},{["id"]="att-208096-a76815162308:clear-chillheart",["kind"]="objective",["text"]="In the first classroom, defeat Instructor Chillheart. If her body falls but combat continues, destroy the phylactery and stay ahead of the advancing ice wall.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096"},["recovery"]={["text"]="Recheck the named room, selected difficulty and current game objectives. Continue advances only the guide cursor; it never records a kill, unlock, purchase or ownership."},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=208096,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=208096}}}}},["when"]={["negate"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}}},["manual"]=true,["evidenceDescriptor"]={["kind"]="encounter-defeated",["encounterId"]=659,["scope"]="current-instance"},["after"]={"att-208096-a76815162308:modern-entry"}},{["id"]="att-208096-a76815162308:clear-jandice",["kind"]="objective",["text"]="Follow the dungeon passage into the illusion room and defeat Jandice Barov. When she splits, find and damage the real Jandice; leave the dangerous ground effects.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096"},["recovery"]={["text"]="Recheck the named room, selected difficulty and current game objectives. Continue advances only the guide cursor; it never records a kill, unlock, purchase or ownership."},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=208096,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=208096}}}}},["when"]={["negate"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}}},["manual"]=true,["evidenceDescriptor"]={["kind"]="encounter-defeated",["encounterId"]=663,["scope"]="current-instance"},["after"]={"att-208096-a76815162308:clear-chillheart"}},{["id"]="att-208096-a76815162308:clear-rattlegore",["kind"]="objective",["text"]="Continue into the bone-filled chamber and defeat Rattlegore. Click a bone pile for Bone Armor if Bone Spike threatens you; avoid the blue Soulflame patches.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096"},["recovery"]={["text"]="Recheck the named room, selected difficulty and current game objectives. Continue advances only the guide cursor; it never records a kill, unlock, purchase or ownership."},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=208096,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=208096}}}}},["when"]={["negate"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}}},["manual"]=true,["evidenceDescriptor"]={["kind"]="encounter-defeated",["encounterId"]=665,["scope"]="current-instance"},["after"]={"att-208096-a76815162308:clear-jandice"}},{["id"]="att-208096-a76815162308:lilian",["kind"]="objective",["text"]="Continue beyond the rare’s room to Lilian Voss. During her soul phase move away from the pursuing soul and the purple flames; let the scripted phases finish before continuing toward the headmaster.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096","https://www.wowhead.com/npc=59200"},["recovery"]={["text"]="Recheck the named room, selected difficulty and current game objectives. Continue advances only the guide cursor; it never records a kill, unlock, purchase or ownership."},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=208096,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=208096}}}}},["when"]={["negate"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}}},["manual"]=true,["after"]={"att-208096-a76815162308:clear-rattlegore"}},{["id"]="att-208096-a76815162308:gandling",["kind"]="objective",["text"]="Pass the Viewing Room and descend into Headmaster’s Retreat. Defeat Darkmaster Gandling. If Harsh Lesson teleports you away, clear the study-room enemies to return; dispelling a living subject can burst nearby undead.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096","https://www.wowhead.com/npc=59080"},["recovery"]={["text"]="Recheck the named room, selected difficulty and current game objectives. Continue advances only the guide cursor; it never records a kill, unlock, purchase or ownership."},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=208096,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=208096}}}}},["when"]={["negate"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}}},["manual"]=true,["after"]={"att-208096-a76815162308:lilian"}},{["id"]="att-208096-a76815162308:summon-eva",["kind"]="interact",["text"]="After Gandling, go to the upper central study room and stand by its bone pile. Use Krastinov’s Bag of Horrors, or have your companion use it there, to reveal Eva Sarkhoff. Remove the Surgical Alterations toy buff so she will speak to you.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096"},["recovery"]={["text"]="The ordinary Caer Darrow ghost and the newly summoned dungeon Eva are different interactions. Check the upper room and bone pile, then remove the disguise. Continue only moves the cursor until her actual dialogue or item is observed."},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}},{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=206365,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=13544,["quantity"]=1}}},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=208096,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=208096}}}}},["when"]={["negate"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}}},["manual"]=true,["after"]={"att-208096-a76815162308:gandling"}},{["id"]="att-208096-a76815162308:eva-dialogue",["kind"]="interact",["text"]="Speak with the revealed Eva and exhaust her ritual dialogue. Receive Inert Spectral Essence if you do not already have Spectral Essence. Loot Eva’s Femur from the adjacent bones.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096","https://www.wowhead.com/item=206365"},["recovery"]={["text"]="If no Inert Spectral Essence is offered, look for the existing unique trinket in bags or bank. Speak before trying to loot the femur; do not discard veteran items."},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}},{["all"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=206365,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=13544,["quantity"]=1}}},{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=206364,["quantity"]=1}}}}},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=208096,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=208096}}}}},["when"]={["negate"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}}},["manual"]=true,["after"]={"att-208096-a76815162308:summon-eva"}},{["id"]="att-208096-a76815162308:eva-journal",["kind"]="collect",["text"]="Before leaving, return to the Viewing Room. Walk behind the southwestern bookcase near the doorway and collect Eva’s Journal from its shelf.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096"},["recovery"]={["text"]="Recheck the named room, selected difficulty and current game objectives. Continue advances only the guide cursor; it never records a kill, unlock, purchase or ownership."},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}},{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=206346,["quantity"]=1}}},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=208096,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=208096}}}}},["when"]={["negate"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}}},["manual"]=true,["after"]={"att-208096-a76815162308:eva-dialogue"}},{["id"]="att-208096-a76815162308:restore-essence",["kind"]="craft",["text"]="Use Inert Spectral Essence with the three Dark Runes and five Essence of Undeath to restore Spectral Essence. Equip the restored trinket before looking for Caer Darrow’s ghosts.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096","https://www.wowhead.com/item=206365"},["recovery"]={["text"]="Restoring consumes the listed materials and is a player action. If the trinket is already restored, equip it rather than making another. Inventory possession alone does not prove that it is equipped."},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}},{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=13544,["quantity"]=1}}},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=208096,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=208096}}}}},["when"]={["negate"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}}},["manual"]=true,["consumesItems"]={{["itemId"]=20520,["quantity"]=3},{["itemId"]=12808,["quantity"]=5}},["after"]={"att-208096-a76815162308:eva-journal"}},{["id"]="att-208096-a76815162308:collect-water",["kind"]="collect",["text"]="Collect the water bucket beside the fountain.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096"},["recovery"]={["text"]="These ritual objects require Eva’s introduction. Keep the live ritual items; already exchanged items need not be collected again. If the object is absent, check Eva’s dialogue and whether the matching candle is already in bags."},["destination"]={["mapID"]=22,["x"]=0.688,["y"]=0.789,["label"]="Water by Caer Darrow fountain"},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}},{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=206359,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=206354,["quantity"]=1}}},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=208096,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=208096}}}}},["when"]={["negate"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}}},["manual"]=true,["after"]={"att-208096-a76815162308:restore-essence"}},{["id"]="att-208096-a76815162308:trade-water",["kind"]="purchase",["text"]="With Spectral Essence equipped, speak to Joseph Dirte and trade Caer Darrow Fountain Water for Stinky Candle. Confirm the trade yourself.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096"},["recovery"]={["text"]="If the ghost is invisible, equip Spectral Essence. Check the exact item and NPC; a trade consumes the memento. Do not infer it occurred from arrival."},["destination"]={["mapID"]=22,["x"]=0.68,["y"]=0.748,["label"]="Joseph Dirte"},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}},{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=206354,["quantity"]=1}}},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=208096,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=208096}}}}},["when"]={["negate"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}}},["manual"]=true,["consumesItems"]={{["itemId"]=206359,["quantity"]=1}},["npcId"]=11316,["after"]={"att-208096-a76815162308:collect-water"}},{["id"]="att-208096-a76815162308:collect-deed",["kind"]="collect",["text"]="Inside the town hall, take the deed from the wall.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096"},["recovery"]={["text"]="These ritual objects require Eva’s introduction. Keep the live ritual items; already exchanged items need not be collected again. If the object is absent, check Eva’s dialogue and whether the matching candle is already in bags."},["destination"]={["mapID"]=22,["x"]=0.436,["y"]=0.693,["label"]="Andorhal town hall"},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}},{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=206362,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=206357,["quantity"]=1}}},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=208096,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=208096}}}}},["when"]={["negate"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="achievement",["achievementId"]=18368,["scope"]="account"},{["kind"]="questTurnedIn",["questId"]=76249,["cadence"]="once",["scope"]="warband"}}}},["manual"]=true,["after"]={"att-208096-a76815162308:trade-water"}},{["id"]="att-208096-a76815162308:trade-deed",["kind"]="purchase",["text"]="With Spectral Essence equipped, speak to Magistrate Marduke and trade The Deed to Andorhal for Authentic Andorhal Candle. Confirm the trade yourself.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db