ructions and recovery have not been authored.","Quest 10674 has live objective tracking, but its source-specific objective instructions and recovery have not been authored.","Quest 10675 has live objective tracking, but its source-specific objective instructions and recovery have not been authored."},["completePath"]=false},["coverageGaps"]={"Quest 10584: AND/OR semantics for 10580, 10581 are not established.","Quest 10584 has live objective tracking, but its source-specific objective instructions and recovery have not been authored.","Quest 10657 has live objective tracking, but its source-specific objective instructions and recovery have not been authored.","Quest 10674 has live objective tracking, but its source-specific objective instructions and recovery have not been authored.","Quest 10675 has live objective tracking, but its source-specific objective instructions and recovery have not been authored."},["aliasOf"]="quest-path-att-30690-8931763b52c9"},{["id"]="att-32782-1ee9659d91ab",["title"]="Collect Time-Lost Figurine",["zone"]="Map 108 · NPC 21838",["expansion"]="The Burning Crusade",["method"]="NPC source",["cadence"]="once",["minutes"]=15,["rewards"]={32782},["requirements"]={["level"]=15},["destination"]={["mapID"]=108,["x"]=0.662,["y"]=0.775},["npcId"]=21838,["questIds"]={},["source"]="https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua",["details"]="Structured route facts from the pinned ATT dataset. Check the offered quest, vendor stock or encounter in game; location and requirements are not a guarantee of a drop.",["metadataRoute"]=true,["costs"]={{"i",32720,1}},["facts"]={["awp"]=20003,["b"]=1,["category"]="Zones",["coords"]={["108"]={{66.2,77.5}}},["cost"]={{"i",32720,1}},["description"]="The process to summon this boss is as follows.\010\0101. Collect Shadow Dust from mobs in Skettis.\0102. Turn in 6 Shadow Dust to Severin for the quest More Shadow Dust to obtain Elixir of Shadows.\0103. Drink the elixir to gain a 20-minute buff that allows you to see Time-Lost mobs around Skettis.\0104. Kill these mobs to obtain Time-Lost Scrolls (40 required per summon).\0105. Make sure you are on the Adversarial Blood quest if this is your first time; it begins with the quest Ishaal's Almanac.\0106. Go to a skull pile and use 10 Time-Lost Scrolls to summon boss. (Darkscreecher Akkarai [Akkarai's Talons], Karrog [Karrog's Spine], Gezzarak the Huntress [Gezzarak's Claws], Vakkiz the Windrager [Vakkiz's Scale]).\0107. Take these 4 items to Hazzik to complete Adversarial Blood which rewards a Time-Lost Offering.\0108. Use the Time-Lost Offering at the Ancient Skull Pile on middle island to summon Terokk. (It has about a 15-minute spawn timer)",["headers"]={-732,-46},["itemId"]=32782,["lineage"]={{["coords"]={["108"]={{66.2,77.5}}},["cost"]={{"i",32720,1}},["description"]="The process to summon this boss is as follows.\010\0101. Collect Shadow Dust from mobs in Skettis.\0102. Turn in 6 Shadow Dust to Severin for the quest More Shadow Dust to obtain Elixir of Shadows.\0103. Drink the elixir to gain a 20-minute buff that allows you to see Time-Lost mobs around Skettis.\0104. Kill these mobs to obtain Time-Lost Scrolls (40 required per summon).\0105. Make sure you are on the Adversarial Blood quest if this is your first time; it begins with the quest Ishaal's Almanac.\0106. Go to a skull pile and use 10 Time-Lost Scrolls to summon boss. (Darkscreecher Akkarai [Akkarai's Talons], Karrog [Karrog's Spine], Gezzarak the Huntress [Gezzarak's Claws], Vakkiz the Windrager [Vakkiz's Scale]).\0107. Take these 4 items to Hazzik to complete Adversarial Blood which rewards a Time-Lost Offering.\0108. Use the Time-Lost Offering at the Ancient Skull Pile on middle island to summon Terokk. (It has about a 15-minute spawn timer)",["kind"]="NPC",["npcID"]=21838,["providers"]={{"o",185928}},["record"]=160125},{["b"]=1,["itemID"]=32782,["kind"]="Toy",["record"]=160134}},["local