rder and ask for the Burning Crusade timeline. Reach old Isle of Quel’Danas; the Shattrath central-chamber portal is an alternative approach when it actually reaches the legacy island.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/item=35275","https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/old-magisters-terrace/2271808","https://www.wowhead.com/quest=56903"},["recovery"]={["text"]="Check that the world map is old Isle of Quel’Danas (122), not Midnight’s map (2424). The revamped Magisters’ Terrace has different bosses and is not this toy route. A transport must remain player-selected."},["destination"]={["mapID"]=23,["x"]=0.5387,["y"]=0.0865,["label"]="Zidormi / legacy Quel’Thalas border"},["manual"]=true,["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=35275,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=35275}}}},{["id"]="att-35275-7f1525b47019:heroic-entry",["kind"]="travel",["text"]="Select Heroic dungeon difficulty yourself and enter old Magisters’ Terrace at the northeast of the old island. Check that the dungeon contains Selin Fireheart rather than Midnight’s Arcanotron.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/item=35275","https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/old-magisters-terrace/2271808","https://www.wowhead.com/quest=56903"},["recovery"]={["text"]="Recheck the named room, selected difficulty and current game objectives. Continue advances only the guide cursor; it never records a kill, unlock, purchase or ownership."},["destination"]={["mapID"]=122,["x"]=0.6123,["y"]=0.3094,["label"]="Old Magisters’ Terrace entrance"},["manual"]=true,["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=35275,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=35275}}},["after"]={"att-35275-7f1525b47019:legacy-quel-danas"}},{["id"]="att-35275-7f1525b47019:selin",["kind"]="objective",["text"]="Clear the opening terrace to Selin Fireheart. Defeat him and loot his corpse; destroy a crystal he drains if the fight requires it. The Orb may already drop here.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/item=35275","https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/old-magisters-terrace/2271808","https://www.wowhead.com/quest=56903"},["recovery"]={["text"]="Recheck the named room, selected difficulty and current game objectives. Continue advances only the guide cursor; it never records a kill, unlock, purchase or ownership."},["manual"]=true,["evidenceDescriptor"]={["kind"]="encounter-defeated",["encounterId"]=530,["scope"]="current-instance"},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=35275,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=35275}}},["after"]={"att-35275-7f1525b47019:heroic-entry"}},{["id"]="att-35275-7f1525b47019:vexallus",["kind"]="objective",["text"]="Continue along the terrace passage to Vexallus. Handle the Pure Energy adds while defeating him, then loot his corpse for another Orb opportunity.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/item=35275","https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/old-magisters-terrace/2271808","https://www.wowhead.com/quest=56903"},["recovery"]={["text"]="Recheck the named room, selected difficulty and current game objectives. Continue advances only the guide cursor; it never records a kill, unlock, purchase or ownership."},["manual"]=true,["evidenceDescriptor"]={["kind"]="encounter-defeated",["encounterId"]=531,["scope"]="current-instance"},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=35275,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=35275}}},["after"]={"att-35275-7f1525b47019:selin"}},{["id"]="att-35275-7f1525b47019:delrissa",["kind"]="objective",["text"]="Proceed into Priestess Delrissa’s courtyard. Defeat her and her four companions, interrupting their healing where possible, then loot Delrissa.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/item=35275","https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/old-magisters-terrace/2271808","https://www.wowhead.com/quest=56903"},["recovery"]={["text"]="Recheck the named room, selected difficulty and current game objectives. Continue advances only the guide cursor; it never records a kill, unlock, purchase or ownership."},["manual"]=true,["evidenceDescriptor"]={["kind"]="encounter-defeated",["encounterId"]=532,["scope"]="current-instance"},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=35275,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=35275}}},["after"]={"att-35275-7f1525b47019:vexallus"}},{["id"]="att-35275-7f1525b47019:kaelthas",["kind"]="loot",["text"]="Follow the remaining hall to Kael’thas Sunstrider. Defeat him through Gravity Lapse if it occurs, avoiding the floating orbs, and loot for the final Orb opportunity.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/item=35275","https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/old-magisters-terrace/2271808","https://www.wowhead.com/quest=56903"},["recovery"]={["text"]="All four bosses are sources on Heroic. No drop means the goal remains open; the Heroic dungeon’s observed daily reset governs another full opportunity set."},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=35275,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=35275}}},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=35275,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=35275}}}}},["after"]={"att-35275-7f1525b47019:delrissa"}