ter the observed reset."},["manual"]=true,["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=88566,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=88566}}},["after"]={"att-88566-471161610f20:rattlegore"}},{["id"]="att-88566-471161610f20:loot",["kind"]="loot",["text"]="If Krastinov appeared, defeat him and loot Krastinov’s Bag of Horrors. Check the corpse and bag space before leaving.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/item=88566"},["recovery"]={["text"]="The rare spawn is uncertain. A Rattlegore kill, yell or Krastinov kill does not prove toy receipt; keep the goal open until the item or ownership is observed."},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=88566,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=88566}}},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=88566,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=88566}}}}},["after"]={"att-88566-471161610f20:rare-room"},["writtenDestination"]="Modern Scholomance: the room immediately beyond Rattlegore’s bone chamber; Krastinov appears here when this run has the rare spawn."},{["id"]="att-88566-471161610f20:learn",["kind"]="learn",["text"]="Use Krastinov’s Bag of Horrors from your bags to learn the toy.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/item=88566"},["recovery"]={["text"]="Only Toy Box ownership finishes this goal. Loot, mail, an achievement and the guide cursor remain separate evidence."},["completeWhen"]={["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=88566},["requires"]={["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=88566,["quantity"]=1},["after"]={"att-88566-471161610f20:loot"}}},["outcome"]="random-drop",["currentPeriodFlag"]=false,["playStyle"]="group",["coverage"]="walkthrough",["walkthrough"]={["version"]=2,["contentVersion"]="2.4.0",["routeId