 for Doctor Theolen Krastinov. His arrival yell announces a spawn; he is not detectable at the dungeon entrance.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/item=88566"},["recovery"]={["text"]="If he is absent after Rattlegore, this run has no observed rare opportunity. Do not wait on a guessed respawn or reset a completed Heroic boss for another daily attempt. Use another eligible character or return after the observed reset."},["manual"]=true,["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=88566,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=88566}}},["after"]={"att-88566-471161610f20:rattlegore"}},{["id"]="att-88566-471161610f20:loot",["kind"]="loot",["text"]="If Krastinov appeared, defeat him and loot Krastinov’s Bag of Horrors. Check the corpse and bag space before leaving.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/item=88566"},["recovery"]={["text"]="The rare spawn is uncertain. A Rattlegore kill, yell or Krastinov kill does not prove toy receipt; keep the goal open until the item or ownership is observed."},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=88566,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=88566}}},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=88566,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=88566}}}}},["after"]={"att-88566-471161610f20:rare-room"},["writtenDestination"]="Modern Scholomance: the room immediately beyond Rattlegore’s bone chamber; Krastinov appears here when this run has the rare spawn."},{["id"]="att-88566-471161610f20:learn",["kind"]="learn",["text"]="Use Krastinov’s Bag of Horrors from your bags to learn the toy.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/item=88566"},["recovery"]={["text"]="Only Toy Box ownership finishes this goal. Loot, mail, an achievement and the guide cursor remain separate evidence."},["completeWhen"]={["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=88566},["requires"]={["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=88566,["quantity"]=1},["after"]={"att-88566-471161610f20:loot"}}}},["validation"]={["sourceChecked"]=true,["completePath"]=true,["checkpointChecked"]=false,["playtested"]=false,["reviewedAt"]="2026-10-25",["gaps"]={}},["coverageGaps"]={"Source-specific interaction, phase or prerequisite mechanics need authored actions.","NPC 59369 has no verified location."},["authored"]=true,["instanceContext"]={["instanceId"]=246,["savedInstanceId"]=1007,["validDifficultyIds"]={2},["opportunity"]="One Heroic instance reset opportunity per character; rare spawn not guaranteed.",["resetEvidence"]="Use current game saved-instance reset time."}},{["id"]="att-88802-0026eb0b4e26",["title"]="Collect Foxicopter Controller",["zone"]="Map 376 · NPC 55143",["expansion"]="Mists of Pandaria",["method"]="NPC source",["cadence"]="once",["minutes"]=15,["rewards"]={88802},["requirements"]={["level"]=15},["destination"]={["mapID"]=376,["x"]=0.16,["y"]=0.83},["npcId"]=55143,["questIds"]={},["source"]="https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua",["details"]="Structured route facts from the pinned ATT dataset. Check the offered quest, vendor stock or encounter in game; location and requirements are not a guarantee of a drop.",["metadataRoute"]=true,["costs"]={{"g",10000000}},["facts"]={["awp"]=50004,["b"]=1,["category"]="Zones",["coords"]={["376"]={{16,83}}},["cost"]=10000000,["headers"]={-732,-58},["itemId"]=88802,["lineage"]={{["coords"]={["376"]={{16,83}}},["kind"]="NPC",["npcID"]=55143,["record"]=181443},{["b"]=1,["cost"]=10000000,["itemID"]=88802,["kind"]="Toy",["record"]=181444}},["localFacts"]={["b"]=1,["cost"]=10000000,["item