UG...just kidding; stay out of its melee range.",["difficulties"]={7,1,2,3,4,5,6},["difficultyID"]=118,["expansionID"]=5,["headers"]={-75,-63},["instanceID"]=362,["isRaid"]=1,["itemId"]=98136,["lineage"]={{["awp"]=50200,["coords"]={["504"]={{63.4,32.6}}},["instanceID"]=362,["isRaid"]=1,["kind"]="Instance",["maps"]={508,509,510,511,512,513,514,515},["record"]=353463},{["coords"]={["390"]={{83,30.6}}},["crs"]={80633},["difficulties"]={7,1,2,3,4,5,6},["difficultyID"]=118,["kind"]="Difficulty",["record"]=353859},{["b"]=1,["crs"]={68220},["description"]="Go up and give this mob a BIG HUG...just kidding; stay out of its melee range.",["itemID"]=98136,["kind"]="Toy",["record"]=353864}},["localFacts"]={["b"]=1,["crs"]={68220},["description"]="Go up and give this mob a BIG HUG...just kidding; stay out of its melee range.",["itemID"]=98136,["kind"]="Toy",["record"]=353864},["maps"]={508,509,510,511,512,513,514,515}},["steps"]={{["id"]="att-98136-c466e701569c:han",["kind"]="interact",["text"]="Use Lorewalker Han’s Forgotten Depths legacy Raid Finder entry at the Seat of Knowledge.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/item=98136","https://www.wowhead.com/npc=68220","https://www.wowhead.com/item=98132","https://www.wowhead.com/guide/legacy-raid-guide-loot-lockouts-raid-skips-lfr-access-legacy-loot-and-transmog-23879"},["recovery"]={["text"]="Recheck the named room, selected difficulty and current game objectives. Continue advances only the guide cursor; it never records a kill, unlock, purchase or ownership."},["destination"]={["mapID"]=390,["x"]=0.83,["y"]=0.306,["label"]="Lorewalker Han at the Seat of Knowledge",["directions"]="Inside the upper Seat of Knowledge above Mogu’shan Palace. Use a supported current route to the upper building."},["manual"]=true,["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=98136,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=98136}}}},{["id"]="att-98136-c466e701569c:tortos",["kind"]="objective",["text"]="Defeat Tortos to open the cavern route. If needed, damage Whirl Turtles until they retreat into their shells, then use Kick Shell to send a shell at Tortos during Furious Stone Breath. Avoid falling rocks and the cave bats.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/item=98136","https://www.wowhead.com/npc=68220","https://www.wowhead.com/item=98132","https://www.wowhead.com/guide/legacy-raid-guide-loot-lockouts-raid-skips-lfr-access-legacy-loot-and-transmog-23879"},["recovery"]={["text"]="Kick an available defeated turtle shell, not a live turtle. If you cannot finish the encounter safely, use a suitable group or another activity; this guide makes no solo-readiness claim."},["manual"]=true,["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=98136,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=98136}}},["after"]={"att-98136-c466e701569c:han"}},{["id"]="att-98136-c466e701569c:gastropods",["kind"]="loot",["text"]="Proceed from Tortos into the connecting Forgotten Depths caverns toward Megaera. Find Gastropods on the route and kill them from range before they reach you. Loot each for Gastropod Shell.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/item=98136","https://www.wowhead.com/npc=68220","https://www.wowhead.com/item=98132","https://www.wowhead.com/guide/legacy-raid-guide-loot-lockouts-raid-skips-lfr-access-legacy-loot-and-transmog-23879"},["recovery"]={["text"]="Gastropods can kill at close range; do not run into them. This is trash loot, not a guaranteed Tortos drop. Use the current saved instance and surviving trash to establish opportunities; repeated queue/reset actions do not prove respawned loot."},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=98136,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=98136}}},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=98136,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=98136}}}}},["after"]={"att-98136-c466e701569c:tortos"},["writtenDestination"]="Forgotten Depths: after Tortos opens the onward route, follow the connecting caverns toward Megaera. Gastropods are the snails on this connecting route, not boss loot."},{["id"]="att-98136-c466e701569c:learn",["kind"]="learn",["text"]="Use Gastropod Shell from your bags to learn the toy.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/item=98136"},["recovery"]={["text"]="Only Toy Box ownership finishes this goal. Loot, mail, an achievement and the guide cursor remain separate evidence."},["completeWhen"]={["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=98136},["requires"]={["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=98136,["quantity"]=1},["after"]={"att-98136-c466e701569c:gastropods"}}},["outcome"]="random-drop",["currentPeriodFlag"]=false,["playStyle"]="group",["coverage"]="walkthrough",["walkthrough"]={["version"]=2,["contentVersion"]="2.4.0",["routeIds"]={"att-98136-c466e701569c"},["includesPrerequisites"]=true,["completeWhen"]={["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=98136},["nodes"]={{["id"]="att-98136-c466e701569c:han",["kind"]="interact",["text"]="Use Lorewalker Han’s Forgotten Depths legacy Raid Finder entry at the Seat of Knowledge.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/item=98136","https://www.wowhead.com/npc=68220","https://www.wowhead.com/item=98132","https://www.wowhead.com/guide/legacy-raid-guide-loot-lockouts-raid-skips-lfr-access-legacy-loot-and-transmog-23879"},["recovery"]={["text"]="Recheck the named room, selected difficulty and current game ob