/www.wowhead.com/guide/legacy-raid-guide-loot-lockouts-raid-skips-lfr-access-legacy-loot-and-transmog-23879"},["recovery"]={["text"]="Recheck the named room, selected difficulty and current game objectives. Continue advances only the guide cursor; it never records a kill, unlock, purchase or ownership."},["destination"]={["mapID"]=390,["x"]=0.83,["y"]=0.306,["label"]="Lorewalker Han at the Seat of Knowledge",["directions"]="Inside the upper Seat of Knowledge above Mogu’shan Palace. Use a supported current route to the upper building."},["manual"]=true,["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=98132,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=98132}}}},{["id"]="att-98132-59488946a52e:geysers",["kind"]="travel",["text"]="At the start of the Tortos section, find the ring of small water spouts around the larger return geyser. Use the small spouts for the stacking challenge; the central large geyser returns you upward.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/item=98132","https://www.wowhead.com/npc=80633","https://www.wowhead.com/guide/legacy-raid-guide-loot-lockouts-raid-skips-lfr-access-legacy-loot-and-transmog-23879"},["recovery"]={["text"]="This is in Forgotten Depths before Tortos. If you overshot into later sections, return through the dungeon paths; the large geysers provide upward travel. A Tortos kill is not the reward condition."},["manual"]=true,["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=98132,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=98132}}},["after"]={"att-98132-59488946a52e:han"},["writtenDestination"]="Forgotten Depths legacy LFR: before entering Tortos’s arena, find the ring of small water spouts around the larger upward-return geyser. The small spouts are the challenge course."},{["id"]="att-98132-59488946a52e:spray-water",["kind"]="interact",["text"]="Step onto a small geyser while facing the next. Turn in the air and land on another spout before Spray Water expires. Correct a slight miss by moving onto the spout while keeping your facing aimed at the following one. Build 250 consecutive stacks.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/item=98132","https://www.wowhead.com/npc=80633","https://www.wowhead.com/guide/legacy-raid-guide-loot-lockouts-raid-skips-lfr-access-legacy-loot-and-transmog-23879"},["recovery"]={["text"]="If the stack expires, begin a new chain. Avoid immunity effects that remove the debuff. Do not assert an achievement from this minigame; reaching the stacks and receiving the mailed toy are separate."},["manual"]=true,["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=98132,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=98132}}},["after"]={"att-98132-59488946a52e:geysers"}},{["id"]="att-98132-59488946a52e:mail",["kind"]="receive",["text"]="After reaching 250 stacks, visit a mailbox and collect Taoshi’s letter containing Shado-Pan Geyser Gun.",["sources"]={"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/item=98132","https://www.wowhead.com/npc=80633","https://www.wowhead.com/guide/legacy-raid-guide-loot-lockouts-raid-skips-lfr-access-legacy-loot-and-transmog-23879"},["recovery"]={["text"]="The item arrives by mail rather than appearing directly in bags. Check mail and bag space; Continue or the Tortos kill cannot manufacture the reward."},["completeWhen"]={["any"]={{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=98132,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=98132}}},{["any"]={{["kind"]="itemCount",["itemId"]=98132,["quantity"]=1},{["kind"]="toyOwned",["itemId"]=98132}}}}},["after"]={"att-98132-59488946a52e:spray-water"}},{["id"]="att-98132-59488946a52e:learn",["kind"]="learn",["text"]=